{"sections":[{"slug":"完备","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"完备"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">完备</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“完备”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">本文介绍的是环关于理想的完备性</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">环</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于理想</span> $I$ <span lang=\"zh\">完备是指映射</span>\n$$\r\nR \\to \\operatorname{colim}R/I^n\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">等价地</span>, $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $I$-<span lang=\"zh\">进拓扑下构成</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/完备拓扑空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">完备拓扑空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">分次环</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">完备是指</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于理想</span> $\\bigoplus_{i&gt;0}A_i$ <span lang=\"zh\">完备</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/形式幂级数环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式幂级数环</span>"}},{"Plain":" $R[x](x.md)$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于理想</span> $(x)$ <span lang=\"zh\">完备</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">可逆元</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于</span> $I$ <span lang=\"zh\">完备</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">元素</span> $u$ <span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $I$ <span lang=\"zh\">可逆</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $u$ <span lang=\"zh\">可逆</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">由假设</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">存在</span> $y\\in R$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $a=1-uy \\in I$. <span lang=\"zh\">由完备性</span>,\n$$\r\nu^{-1} = y (1+a+a^2+\\cdots).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}